  "description": "Cluster monitor for the single-node k3d stack: host state (node-exporter) and live status of every Prometheus scrape target. kube-state-metrics / kubelet / cAdvisor are not scraped by this profile, so classic #315-style kube_*/container_* panels would be empty.",
